{
  "slug": "thinking-partner",
  "name": "Thinking Partner",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A deterministic thinking partner that challenges assumptions and applies 150+ mental models across 17 disciplines to sharpen decisions, solve problems, and think more clearly. Features include orientation\ndetection that diagnoses 6 thinking states with targeted interventions, a structured 6-step workflow from diagnosis to synthesis, 7 complementary cognitive operation pairs, and explicit anti-patterns to\navoid common reasoning failures. Works as a sparring session, not a lecture, asks one question at a time, names the model being applied, and challenges where it matters.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `thinking-partner` (A deterministic thinking partner that challenges assumptions and applies mental models to sharpen decisions, solve problems, and think…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install thinking-partner@claude-community` from `mattnowdev/thinking-partner`.",
